<title>GREECE: BANKS MAY QUOTE ATHIBOR PRICES IF THEY WISH - HBA.</title>
<headline>BANKS MAY QUOTE ATHIBOR PRICES IF THEY WISH - HBA.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Union of Hellenic Banks said banks could feed Athibor quotes if they wished to do so after the elimination of early morning quotes because of confusion over a possible tax on interbank depos.</p>
<p>&quot;The HBA after requests by several banks accepted the elimination of early morning quotes on Athibor. However, all pages are currently active and banks may feed quotes if they wish to do so,&quot; an HBA official told Reuters. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
